        <!-- Body timelines. The rest pose: Hop at y 765, unrotated and unscaled; Head
             at y 578; every rotation 0; no glance; the lids up and the arches down,
             out of the eyes; the smile shown and every other mouth hidden; the
             catchlights and sparks hidden; the shadow at full width and opacity. -->
